OL,3,ATrump says US taking 'very seriously'
OL,4,Aany Iranian plot against Washington
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has said the US
OL,7,Fis taking "very seriously" the
OL,8,Fpotential for any Iranian plot to
OL,9,Fattack Washington DC, after he was
OL,10,Fasked about a CNN report citing US
OL,11,Fintelligence assessments.
OL,13,FIn the Philippines, where he attended
OL,14,Fthe Asean Summit, Trump nodded when
OL,15,Fasked by a journalist about the report
OL,16,Fthat Tehran was planning to detonate a
OL,17,Fso-called dirty bomb in the US capital
OL,18,Fand said: "We're looking into it."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
