OL,3,ATrump says US taking 'very seriously'
OL,4,Aany Iranian plot against Washington
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN cited unnamed US intelligence
OL,7,Fofficials suggesting Iran could target
OL,8,Fsenior figures in Trump's
OL,9,Fadministration with such an attack.
OL,11,FIran called the claim "baseless."
OL,12,FConcerns about dirty bombs grew after
OL,13,Fthe 9/11 attacks in 2001, although no
OL,14,Fsuch attack has ever occurred.
